   "html_text": "Base clauses: ‘Snow is white’ is true if and only if snow is white. ‘Grass is green’ is true if and only if grass is green. Recursion clauses. For any sentences ⟦M⟧ and ⟦M⟧ of ⟦M⟧ : ⟦M⟧ is true if and only if ⟦M⟧ is true or ⟦M⟧ is true. ⟦M⟧ is true if and only if it is not the case that ⟦M⟧ is true.",
